    "People who joined can no longer add songs. This app can’t reopen it; do that in YouTube Music.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Wer beigetreten ist, kann keine Songs mehr hinzufügen. Diese App kann das nicht wieder öffnen; mach das in YouTube Music."
          }
        },
        "de-CH": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Wer beigetreten ist, kann keine Songs mehr hinzufügen. Diese App kann das nicht wieder öffnen; mach das in YouTube Music."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "People who joined can no longer add songs. This app can’t reopen it; do that in YouTube Music."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Quienes se unieron ya no pueden añadir canciones. Esta app no puede volver a abrirla; hazlo en YouTube Music."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Les personnes qui ont rejoint la playlist ne peuvent plus y ajouter de titres. Cette app ne peut pas la rouvrir ; faites-le dans YouTube Music."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Присоединившиеся больше не могут добавлять песни. Приложение не может открыть доступ снова; сделайте это в YouTube Music."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Core string (W28). Every non-English value is a MACHINE SEED pending human review (W42); it is not release quality."
    },
