    "Pick something to start its radio. Only radios YouTube Music offers are listed, and the tuner shows only controls it supplies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Wähle etwas aus, um seinen Radiosender zu starten. Es werden nur Sender aufgelistet, die YouTube Music anbietet, und der Tuner zeigt nur Regler, die es liefert."
          }
        },
        "de-CH": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Wähle etwas aus, um seinen Radiosender zu starten. Es werden nur Sender aufgelistet, die YouTube Music anbietet, und der Tuner zeigt nur Regler, die es liefert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick something to start its radio. Only radios YouTube Music offers are listed, and the tuner shows only controls it supplies."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Elige algo para iniciar su radio. Solo se muestran las radios que ofrece YouTube Music, y el sintonizador solo muestra los controles que esta proporciona."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Choisissez quelque chose pour démarrer sa radio. Seules les radios proposées par YouTube Music sont listées, et le panneau de réglage n’affiche que les commandes qu’il fournit."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Выберите, с чего запустить радио. Перечислены только радио, которые предлагает YouTube Music, а тюнер показывает только те элементы управления, которые он предоставляет."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Core string (W28). Every non-English value is a MACHINE SEED pending human review (W42); it is not release quality."
    },
    "Pick something to start its radio. Radios and any controls come from YouTube Music; the tuner shows only what it supplies.": {
